ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oye,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}gracias por
echarme un cable el otro día,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Estaba muy malico y un poco arisco,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡pero gracias a ti{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} vuelvo a estar
sano como una manzana!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Te he mandado un detallico a casa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡acuérdate de mirar el buzón!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ehilà, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Grazie per essere passat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
a trovarmi quando stavo male!
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Avevo l'influenza, ma sei arrivat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
tu{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} e mi hai salvato la vita!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}È questa la vera amicizia!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Per ringraziarti,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ho mandato
un regalo a casa tua.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tieni d'occhio
la tua cassetta delle lettere!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Geçen gün kendimi
berbat hissederken ziyaretime geldiğin
için sağ ol!
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Soğuk algınlığıyla cebelleşirken{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
çıkagelip resmen hayatımı kurtardın!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}İŞTE buna dostluk denir, değil
mi?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Minnetimin küçük
bir göstergesi olarak{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
evine bir şey yolladım,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} gözün postada olsun!
